{
  "name": "CampusAid UPTC - Enrutamiento de solicitudes",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CampusAid UPTC · Flujo N8N\n**Webhook POST** → valida correo **@uptc.edu.co** → enruta por **tipo_tramite** → **notifica por correo** → responde JSON al frontend.\n\nEl registro ya lo guarda el frontend en Supabase, por eso este flujo NO inserta (evita duplicados).",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Nota general",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Entrada y validación\nRecibe el POST del formulario y rechaza correos que no sean @uptc.edu.co (responde 400).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Nota entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Enrutamiento por tipo de trámite\nSwitch por `tipo_tramite` (Tutoría / Laboratorio / Certificado). Cada rama asigna la coordinación responsable.\n\n⚠️ Cambia los correos `@example.com` por los reales de cada coordinador.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Nota enrutamiento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [400, -20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Notificación y respuesta\nEnvía correo al estudiante (con copia al coordinador) y devuelve `{status, clasificacion, id}` al frontend.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Nota notificación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "campusaid",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook CampusAid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "webhookId": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000aa"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.email_institucional }}",
              "rightValue": "@uptc.edu.co",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "endsWith"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Validar correo UPTC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [240, 300]
